            "revision": 1
          }
        ],
        "text": "The authors express the average partition function of the specified nu-compressible ensemble through a nu-qubit Haar average, give the core scaling, and state a large-2^nu expansion. This is an unverified author-claim candidate."
      }
    ],
    "conditions": [
      {
        "condition_id": "condition:compressible-mean-0",
        "origin": "SOURCE_RECONSTRUCTED",
        "source_span_refs": [
          {
            "content_hash": "sha256:99c21a6dbce4301ce6bb19d973dc062405287847a45bcb44257c4a77fd1ad36c",
            "record_id": "example:2608.14798v1-db635458e365-span-411-429",
            "record_type": "agtxiv.v3.source-span/0.0.0",
            "revision": 1
          },
          {
            "content_hash": "sha256:72b2b63c06bd2187f9791e5440d83e9fa5661de72a149f56c79a80f326e4a6d3",
            "record_id": "example:2608.14798v1-db635458e365-span-984-1011",
            "record_type": "agtxiv.v3.source-span/0.0.0",
            "revision": 1
          },
          {
            "content_hash": "sha256:c9c673016294a6e3a9c9de6c0e696f8b638b39b0c9c4067722d932bb1e48b993",
            "record_id": "example:2608.14798v1-db635458e365-span-1024-1039",
            "record_type": "agtxiv.v3.source-span/0.0.0",
            "revision": 1
          }
        ],
        "statement": "States are prepared from |0>^tensor n using a nu-qubit Haar unitary followed by a uniformly sampled n-qubit Clifford."
      },
      {
        "condition_id": "condition:compressible-mean-1",
        "origin": "SOURCE_RECONSTRUCTED",
        "source_span_refs": [
          {
            "content_hash": "sha256:99c21a6dbce4301ce6bb19d973dc062405287847a45bcb44257c4a77fd1ad36c",
            "record_id": "example:2608.14798v1-db635458e365-span-411-429",
            "record_type": "agtxiv.v3.source-span/0.0.0",
            "revision": 1
          },
          {
            "content_hash": "sha256:72b2b63c06bd2187f9791e5440d83e9fa5661de72a149f56c79a80f326e4a6d3",
            "record_id": "example:2608.14798v1-db635458e365-span-984-1011",
            "record_type": "agtxiv.v3.source-span/0.0.0",
            "revision": 1
          },
          {
            "content_hash": "sha256:c9c673016294a6e3a9c9de6c0e696f8b638b39b0c9c4067722d932bb1e48b993",
            "record_id": "example:2608.14798v1-db635458e365-span-1024-1039",
            "record_type": "agtxiv.v3.source-span/0.0.0",
            "revision": 1
          }
        ],
        "statement": "The sampling measure is mu_(n,nu)=mu_Cl_n * mu_Haar_nu."
      },
      {
        "condition_id": "condition:compressible-mean-2",
        "origin": "SOURCE_RECONSTRUCTED",
        "source_span_refs": [
          {
            "content_hash": "sha256:99c21a6dbce4301ce6bb19d973dc062405287847a45bcb44257c4a77fd1ad36c",
            "record_id": "example:2608.14798v1-db635458e365-span-411-429",
            "record_type": "agtxiv.v3.source-span/0.0.0",
            "revision": 1
          },
          {
            "content_hash": "sha256:72b2b63c06bd2187f9791e5440d83e9fa5661de72a149f56c79a80f326e4a6d3",
            "record_id": "example:2608.14798v1-db635458e365-span-984-1011",
            "record_type": "agtxiv.v3.source-span/0.0.0",
            "revision": 1
          },
          {
            "content_hash": "sha256:c9c673016294a6e3a9c9de6c0e696f8b638b39b0c9c4067722d932bb1e48b993",
            "record_id": "example:2608.14798v1-db635458e365-span-1024-1039",
            "record_type": "agtxiv.v3.source-span/0.0.0",
            "revision": 1
          }
        ],
        "statement": "The asymptotic statement assumes fixed beta and large 2^nu, or beta^2=o(2^nu)."
      },
      {
        "condition_id": "condition:compressible-mean-3",
        "origin": "SOURCE_RECONSTRUCTED",
        "source_span_refs": [
          {
            "content_hash": "sha256:99c21a6dbce4301ce6bb19d973dc062405287847a45bcb44257c4a77fd1ad36c",
            "record_id": "example:2608.14798v1-db635458e365-span-411-429",
            "record_type": "agtxiv.v3.source-span/0.0.0",
            "revision": 1
          },
          {
            "content_hash": "sha256:72b2b63c06bd2187f9791e5440d83e9fa5661de72a149f56c79a80f326e4a6d3",
            "record_id": "example:2608.14798v1-db635458e365-span-984-1011",
            "record_type": "agtxiv.v3.source-span/0.0.0",
            "revision": 1
          },
          {
            "content_hash": "sha256:c9c673016294a6e3a9c9de6c0e696f8b638b39b0c9c4067722d932bb1e48b993",
            "record_id": "example:2608.14798v1-db635458e365-span-1024-1039",
            "record_type": "agtxiv.v3.source-span/0.0.0",
            "revision": 1
          }
        ],
        "statement": "The exact mean identity and the asymptotic corollary have different assertion strengths."
      }
